            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Cleaner transcripts on speakers</h3><ul><li>On speakers, their voice stays out of your mic far more often, so fewer echo lines.</li><li>Echo caught inside one of your lines is cut out, and your own words stay.</li><li>Deepgram calls now catch echo on speakers too.</li><li>Short replies like &quot;Okay&quot; no longer go missing on headphone calls.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.6">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
